                                                "sense_id": "444ba945-6d38-333a-9bf8-89636911777c",
                                                "text": "The tumult was over, and all things returned to their old place; and the abuse remained without remedy, and the wrong without redress. Ah! if the doctrine of amelioration be true, what a mighty debt does the future owe to the past!"
                                            }
                                        ]
